    <name>E-Biketicket 2 RIDE red</name>
    <desc>The mother of all enduro routes, the Biketicket 2 RIDE, has been adapted for the e-bike. This means: singletrails, mountain railways, and thanks to motor support, also great trails uphill.</desc>
